1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,671
Then from Pokhara to Jomsom there are four jeeps.

2
00:00:03,671 --> 00:00:06,250
You do the first leg, and then the second.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:13,007
For each of the five first legs there are four second legs, so the choices multiply: twenty journeys.

4
00:00:13,007 --> 00:00:17,786
The connecting word tells you the rule: OR adds, AND multiplies.

